{"id":"3cefe0e1-4d84-45fe-9b04-0713bdacf377","createdAt":"2026-10-26T14:31:51.907Z","batchId":"settings_gpt-6-luna_medium","approach":"html","modelId":"gpt-6-luna","settings":{"effort":"medium"},"presetId":"settings","prompt":"An account settings panel with profile, notifications and privacy sections.","system":"Return only the body content of an HTML page: no doctype, <html>, <head> or <body> tags, no markdown, no code fences, no prose. The page shell below is already loaded, so build with its classes and chart helper. Inline <script> is allowed for interactivity (tabs, toggles, filters); no external requests. Add a small <style> block only for what the classes cannot express, or when the request asks for a different look, colours, fonts or layout: then follow the request.\nPAGE SHELL (already loaded; do not restate it):\n- A stylesheet with these classes. Use them instead of writing CSS:\n  layout: page (centered column), stack, row, between, center, gap-sm, gap-lg, grid + cols-2|cols-3|cols-4 (responsive)\n  surfaces: card, card-title, card-desc, alert, alert-destructive, hr\n  text: h1-h4 (styled), lead, muted, small, up, down (trend colours)\n  controls: btn, btn-secondary|btn-outline|btn-ghost|btn-destructive, btn-sm|btn-lg, btn-block; label wraps input/select/textarea; label.check wraps a checkbox or radio\n  data: table (styled; td.num for numbers), badge, badge-secondary|badge-outline|badge-destructive, stat-label, stat-value, progress (inner div with style=\"width:NN%\"), avatar\n- Charts: <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar|line|area|pie\",\"title\":\"…\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"W1\",\"value\":120}]}'></div> renders an SVG chart (single series, pie gets a legend). Do not draw charts yourself.\n- Light and dark mode are handled by the stylesheet.\n\nDESIGN BRIEF (applies to every UI you produce):\n- Build a complete, realistic screen, not a skeleton: a clear title and intro, grouped sections, and enough detail that it could ship.\n- Cover exactly what the request names, with no extra pages or marketing sections.\n- Use the supplied DATA in full: every field is there to be shown. Derive useful extras from it (shares, totals, deltas, rankings) instead of inventing unrelated numbers.\n- Where it fits, add status badges, trend/change figures, secondary actions, helper text, and sensible empty or edge-case copy.\n- Establish hierarchy with headings, size and weight; group related items; keep spacing and alignment consistent.\n- Make charts readable: a title, labelled axes or values, and a legend for pie charts.\n- Never use lorem ipsum or placeholder names like \"Item 1\".","systemHash":"0c16911c9564c3db3ada7a622931ee6ffc820ebf9a373996782a9f1f0fc3c98c","systemOverridden":false,"strictOutput":false,"rawOutput":"<style>\n  .settings-layout { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(180px, 0.7fr) minmax(0, 2.3fr); gap: 1.5rem; align-items: start; }\n  .settings-nav a { display: block; padding: .65rem .75rem; border-radius: .5rem; color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }\n  .settings-nav a:hover, .settings-nav a:focus { background: color-mix(in srgb, currentColor 8%, transparent); }\n  .settings-section { scroll-margin-top: 1rem; }\n  .settings-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1rem; align-items: center; padding: .85rem 0; }\n  .settings-row + .settings-row { border-top: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, currentColor 15%, transparent); }\n  .settings-row-copy { max-width: 38rem; }\n  @media (max-width: 700px) {\n    .settings-layout { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n    .settings-nav { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .25rem; }\n    .settings-row { align-items: flex-start; }\n  }\n</style>\n\n<main class=\"page stack gap-lg\">\n  <header class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n    <p class=\"small muted\">YOUR ACCOUNT</p>\n    <h1>Account settings</h1>\n    <p class=\"lead\">Manage your profile, notification preferences, and privacy choices.</p>\n  </header>\n\n  <div class=\"settings-layout\">\n    <nav class=\"card settings-nav stack\" aria-label=\"Settings sections\">\n      <a href=\"#profile\">Profile</a>\n      <a href=\"#notifications\">Notifications</a>\n      <a href=\"#privacy\">Privacy</a>\n    </nav>\n\n    <div class=\"stack gap-lg\">\n      <section class=\"card settings-section stack gap-lg\" id=\"profile\" aria-labelledby=\"profile-heading\">\n        <div>\n          <h2 class=\"h2\" id=\"profile-heading\">Profile</h2>\n          <p class=\"card-desc\">Update the information associated with your account.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"row gap-lg center\">\n          <div class=\"avatar\" aria-label=\"Profile photo placeholder\">JD</div>\n          <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n            <strong>Profile photo</strong>\n            <p class=\"small muted\">Choose a clear photo so people can recognize you.</p>\n            <div class=\"row gap-sm\">\n              <button class=\"btn btn-secondary btn-sm\" type=\"button\">Upload photo</button>\n              <button class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-sm\" type=\"button\">Remove</button>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <hr class=\"hr\">\n\n        <form class=\"settings-form stack gap-lg\">\n          <div class=\"grid cols-2 gap-lg\">\n            <label>\n              <span class=\"label\">Full name</span>\n              <input type=\"text\" name=\"fullName\" value=\"Jordan Davis\" autocomplete=\"name\" required>\n            </label>\n            <label>\n              <span class=\"label\">Username</span>\n              <input type=\"text\" name=\"username\" value=\"jordandavis\" autocomplete=\"username\" required>\n            </label>\n            <label>\n              <span class=\"label\">Email address</span>\n              <input type=\"email\" name=\"email\" value=\"jordan.davis@example.com\" autocomplete=\"email\" required>\n            </label>\n            <label>\n              <span class=\"label\">Time zone</span>\n              <select name=\"timezone\">\n                <option selected>Pacific Time (UTC−08:00)</option>\n                <option>Mountain Time (UTC−07:00)</option>\n                <option>Central Time (UTC−06:00)</option>\n                <option>Eastern Time (UTC−05:00)</option>\n                <option>Coordinated Universal Time (UTC±00:00)</option>\n              </select>\n            </label>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"between center\">\n            <p class=\"small muted\">Your email is used for account-related messages.</p>\n            <button class=\"btn\" type=\"submit\">Save profile</button>\n          </div>\n        </form>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"card settings-section stack gap-lg\" id=\"notifications\" aria-labelledby=\"notifications-heading\">\n        <div>\n          <h2 class=\"h2\" id=\"notifications-heading\">Notifications</h2>\n          <p class=\"card-desc\">Choose what you hear about and where we send it.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <form class=\"settings-form stack\">\n          <div class=\"settings-row\">\n            <div class=\"settings-row-copy\">\n              <strong>Account and security</strong>\n              <p class=\"small muted\">Important updates about sign-ins and your account.</p>\n            </div>\n            <label class=\"check\" aria-label=\"Email account and security notifications\">\n              <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"securityEmail\" checked>\n              <span>Email</span>\n            </label>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"settings-row\">\n            <div class=\"settings-row-copy\">\n              <strong>Product updates</strong>\n              <p class=\"small muted\">New features, improvements, and occasional announcements.</p>\n            </div>\n            <label class=\"check\" aria-label=\"Email product updates\">\n              <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"productEmail\" checked>\n              <span>Email</span>\n            </label>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"settings-row\">\n            <div class=\"settings-row-copy\">\n              <strong>Monthly account summary</strong>\n              <p class=\"small muted\">A monthly recap of activity on your account.</p>\n            </div>\n            <label class=\"check\" aria-label=\"Receive the monthly account summary\">\n              <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"monthlySummary\">\n              <span>Email</span>\n            </label>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"settings-row\">\n            <div class=\"settings-row-copy\">\n              <strong>Browser notifications</strong>\n              <p class=\"small muted\">Allow notifications in this browser when you’re using the app.</p>\n            </div>\n            <label class=\"check\" aria-label=\"Enable browser notifications\">\n              <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"browserNotifications\">\n              <span>On</span>\n            </label>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"between center\">\n            <p class=\"small muted\">You’ll always receive essential account and security messages.</p>\n            <button class=\"btn\" type=\"submit\">Save preferences</button>\n          </div>\n        </form>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"card settings-section stack gap-lg\" id=\"privacy\" aria-labelledby=\"privacy-heading\">\n        <div>\n          <h2 class=\"h2\" id=\"privacy-heading\">Privacy</h2>\n          <p class=\"card-desc\">Control how your profile can be found and how your data is used.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <form class=\"settings-form stack gap-lg\">\n          <label>\n            <span class=\"label\">Profile visibility</span>\n            <select name=\"visibility\">\n              <option>Public — anyone can view your profile</option>\n              <option selected>Private — only you can view your profile</option>\n            </select>\n            <span class=\"small muted\">You can change this setting at any time.</span>\n          </label>\n\n          <div class=\"settings-row\">\n            <div class=\"settings-row-copy\">\n              <strong>Find me by email</strong>\n              <p class=\"small muted\">Let people with your email address find your profile.</p>\n            </div>\n            <label class=\"check\" aria-label=\"Allow people to find me by email\">\n              <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"findByEmail\">\n              <span>Allow</span>\n            </label>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"settings-row\">\n            <div class=\"settings-row-copy\">\n              <strong>Personalized recommendations</strong>\n              <p class=\"small muted\">Use account activity to make recommendations more relevant.</p>\n            </div>\n            <label class=\"check\" aria-label=\"Allow personalized recommendations\">\n              <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"personalization\" checked>\n              <span>Allow</span>\n            </label>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"hr\"></div>\n\n          <div class=\"between center\">\n            <div>\n              <strong>Download your data</strong>\n              <p class=\"small muted\">Request a copy of the information associated with your account.</p>\n            </div>\n            <button class=\"btn btn-outline\" type=\"button\">Request data</button>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"between center\">\n            <p class=\"small muted\">Save your privacy choices when you’re done.</p>\n            <button class=\"btn\" type=\"submit\">Save privacy settings</button>\n          </div>\n        </form>\n      </section>\n\n      <p class=\"small muted\" id=\"save-status\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</main>\n\n<script>\n  document.querySelectorAll(\".settings-form\").forEach(function (form) {\n    form.addEventListener(\"submit\", function (event) {\n      event.preventDefault();\n      document.getElementById(\"save-status\").textContent = \"Settings saved.\";\n    });\n  });\n</script>","deltas":[[12466,"<style"],[12469,">\n"],[12473," "],[12476," ."],[12484,"settings"],[12493,"-layout"],[12494," {"],[12494," display"],[12494,":"],[12499," grid"],[12535,";"],[12535," grid"],[12535,"-template"],[12535,"-columns"],[12535,":"],[12535," min"],[12535,"max"],[12535,"("],[12536,"180"],[12536,"px"],[12539,","],[12540," "],[12544,"0"],[12549,"."],[12554,"7"],[12556,"fr"],[12562,")"],[12570," min"],[12571,"max"],[12574,"("],[12576,"0"],[12578,","],[12581," "],[12585,"2"],[12588,"."],[12592,"3"],[12595,"fr"],[12597,");"],[12602," gap"],[12605,":"],[12607," "],[12611,"1"],[12613,"."],[12615,"5"],[12618,"rem"],[12620,";"],[12623," align"],[12625,"-items"],[12627,":"],[12630," start"],[12632,";"],[12636," }\n"],[12637," "],[12639," ."],[12640,"settings"],[12644,"-nav"],[12647," a"],[12649," {"],[12657," display"],[12657,":"],[12657," block"],[12658,";"],[12660," padding"],[12663,":"],[12667," ."],[12670,"65"],[12672,"rem"],[12672," ."],[12675,"75"],[12678,"rem"],[12679,";"],[12682," border"],[12685,"-radius"],[12689,":"],[12690," ."],[12693,"5"],[12695,"rem"],[12699,";"],[12700," color"],[12702,":"],[12705," inherit"],[12739,";"],[12740," text"],[12740,"-decoration"],[12740,":"],[12740," none"],[12740,";"],[12740," }\n"],[12740," "],[12740," ."],[12741,"settings"],[12741,"-nav"],[12744," a"],[12746,":hover"],[12748,","],[12756," ."],[12756,"settings"],[12762,"-nav"],[12762," a"],[12769,":"],[12775,"focus"],[12775," {"],[12782," background"],[12782,":"],[12783," color"],[12788,"-m"],[12788,"ix"],[12788,"(in"],[12794," sr"],[12794,"gb"],[12794,","],[12800," current"],[12800,"Color"],[12806," "],[12807,"8"],[12807,"%,"],[12813," transparent"],[12813,");"],[12813," }\n"],[12819," "],[12819," ."],[12825,"settings"],[12825,"-section"],[12825," {"],[12831," scroll"],[12832,"-margin"],[12837,"-top"],[12837,":"],[12838," "],[12844,"1"],[12844,"rem"],[12847,";"],[12849," }\n"],[12853," "],[12857," ."],[12859,"settings"],[12860,"-